  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Clark&#39;s method: In this method calculated amount of lime is added to hard water. It precipitates out calcium carbonate and magnesium hydroxide which can be filtered off.</p><p>Clark&#39;s Method Reaction</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ca</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>Ca</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>HCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>Ca</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CaCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>Mg</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
